; A clock line whose time is followed directly by a byte that is not
; whitespace ("o 2024/01/15 17:00:00X", 22 characters) names an empty
; account.  That is an error; the byte is not dropped to make the line
; a bare check-out.

i 2024/01/15 09:00:00 Alpha
o 2024/01/15 17:00:00X

test bal -> 1
__ERROR__
While parsing file "$FILE", line 7:
Error: Account name contains an empty sub-account name
end test
